    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Status of Implementation Progress: (i) OIMP contract was awarded on 14 Sep 2022. Inception Report dated 12 Dec 2022 was accepted by VPMU on 13 Dec 2022. (ii) Independent Design Review Consultants, and Feasibility Design and Procurement Support Consultants are not yet advertised. (iii) A site selection workshp was conducted in Port Vila on 16 February 2023 where all nominated 10 sites were discussed. A follow-up workshop was conducted in November 2023. MIPU&apos;s decision on priority sites is still pending which is delaying the surveys and eventually the detailed design report. It is expected that MIPU would confirm and prioritize the OIMP wharves by February 2024.

(i) Transport Sector Roadmap and Investment Planning Consultants package was advertised in Q3 2022 and negotiations have been extended up to Q1 2024 with expected contract awarding within January or February 2024. (ii) Institutional Capacity Development Expert, and Maritime Expert positions are not yet advertised. During the review mission fielded on 16-19 January 2024, it was discussed that MIPU, VPMU and ADB will work together on the terms of reference for the institutional capacity expert to develop ports operations and maintenance plan.</narrative>
    </title>
